      "source_xml_line": 1370,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I completed the mission. I brought the grenade launcher.",
      "JA_current": "任務完了だ。Bulldog 6 を持ってきたぞ。",
      "JA_new": "任務は完了した。グレネードランチャーを持ってきた。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1373,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Good work, stalker. This is exactly what we need. Well, Marked One, you carried out my request, and in return you can take this gear. I think you'll like it.",
      "JA_current": "よくやったぞ。これは我々が切望していたものなのだ。さて、Marked One、お前は我々の要求に応えてくれたので、見返りにこのスーツを受け取れ。気にいると思うぞ。",
      "JA_new": "よくやった、ストーカー。これこそ必要だった物だ。マークド・ワン、頼みを果たしてくれた礼に、この装備を持っていけ。気に入ると思う。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_leader_prisyaga_0#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1328,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_leader_prisyaga_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I am ready to swear the oath.",
      "JA_current": "誓いを宣誓する準備はできてるぜ。",
      "JA_new": "誓いを立てる準備はできている。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_leader_quest_rg6_finish",
